{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50090","headline":"海阳泉 · 无名氏","name":"海阳泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人谁无耽爱，各亦有所偏。\n於吾喜尚中，不厌千万泉。\n诚知湟水曲，远在南海壖。\n自从得海阳，便欲终老焉。\n怪石状五岳，旋回枕深渊。\n激繁似涌云，静同冰镜悬。\n吾欲以海阳，跨於河洛间。\n使彼云林客，来游皆忘还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}